    "description": "<p><em>Countdown (Loop 6)</em>. When the Saint takes damage for the first time, activate the countdown. It ticks down when a PC rolls with Hope. When it triggers, spears of holy light descend upon all targets within Far range. Targets must make a Presence Reaction Roll. Targets who fail take <strong>3d6+10</strong> magic damage. Targets who succeed take half damage.</p>",
